1
00:00:07,785 --> 00:00:09,065
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:37,625 --> 00:01:43,065
‎ADAPTED FROM XI XING’S NOVEL
<i>‎QUEEN CHU</i>‎ ON QIDIAN.COM

3
00:02:02,265 --> 00:02:04,185
<i>His crime is unforgivable!</i>

4
00:02:04,265 --> 00:02:07,425
<i>Last night, he burned down</i>
<i>the Wei Village and killed 46 people!</i>

5
00:02:08,144 --> 00:02:10,265
Today, we will

6
00:02:10,345 --> 00:02:12,665
beat him to death in public

7
00:02:12,745 --> 00:02:15,385
to atone for his sins.

8
00:02:16,585 --> 00:02:17,505
<i>Sorry.</i>

9
00:02:17,585 --> 00:02:18,425
CAPITAL

10
00:02:18,505 --> 00:02:19,585
Because of me,

11
00:02:20,825 --> 00:02:22,225
you were also scolded by the elders.

12
00:02:22,745 --> 00:02:23,825
Don't be silly.

13
00:02:23,905 --> 00:02:26,505
As your brother, I must protect you.

14
00:02:26,585 --> 00:02:28,025
Sadly, this is too serious.

15
00:02:28,105 --> 00:02:29,985
Our elders are furious.

16
00:02:30,665 --> 00:02:31,985
Even as the head of our clan,

17
00:02:32,505 --> 00:02:33,745
I can't get you out of it.

18
00:02:37,065 --> 00:02:37,905
Yanlai,

19
00:02:39,345 --> 00:02:41,185
I believe you're innocent.

20
00:02:43,945 --> 00:02:44,945
Once I'm away,

21
00:02:46,785 --> 00:02:48,305
those elders won't come after you anymore.

22
00:02:48,905 --> 00:02:50,065
Where are you going?

23
00:02:51,425 --> 00:02:52,545
Any plans?

24
00:02:55,985 --> 00:02:57,305
This is a big world.

25
00:03:00,425 --> 00:03:02,385
I will always have somewhere to go.

26
00:03:03,665 --> 00:03:06,265
This secret elixir only belongs
to our direct line.

27
00:03:07,425 --> 00:03:08,865
It can even revive the dying.

28
00:03:09,945 --> 00:03:10,865
Keep it with you,

29
00:03:11,785 --> 00:03:13,105
in case of emergency.

30
00:03:33,145 --> 00:03:35,225
Sorry, sir. We're closed today.

31
00:03:35,305 --> 00:03:36,145
-Closed.
-Sorry.

32
00:03:36,225 --> 00:03:37,745
-Sorry for that.
-We're closed.

33
00:03:38,345 --> 00:03:41,305
Mr. Deng, the venison and roast pork
of Fenglin Restaurant

34
00:03:41,385 --> 00:03:42,625
are absolutely delicious.

35
00:03:43,145 --> 00:03:45,625
And have some meat soup.
That would be even better.

36
00:03:46,305 --> 00:03:47,225
How about…?

37
00:03:49,105 --> 00:03:50,265
I just need noodles.

38
00:03:53,025 --> 00:03:56,305
When the Yang and Zhao Clans
held great power as imperial in-laws,

39
00:03:57,105 --> 00:03:58,185
a single meal of theirs

40
00:03:58,265 --> 00:04:01,065
would feed an ordinary family
for an entire year.

41
00:04:01,585 --> 00:04:04,585
This gives a glimpse of the extravagance
of the imperial in-laws in power.

42
00:04:04,665 --> 00:04:05,785
Mr. Deng,

43
00:04:05,865 --> 00:04:08,825
we must bring down the Xie Clan.

44
00:04:08,905 --> 00:04:10,705
Yes. Yes, exactly.

45
00:04:10,785 --> 00:04:13,825
We can't let them rise
like the Yang and Zhao Clans.

46
00:04:15,185 --> 00:04:17,504
I wish they would rise
like the Yang and Zhao Clans.

47
00:04:17,585 --> 00:04:19,785
The rebellion of the Third Prince,

48
00:04:19,865 --> 00:04:22,825
the young emperor,
and the foreign invasion…

49
00:04:22,905 --> 00:04:23,905
The root cause

50
00:04:24,425 --> 00:04:26,465
was the trouble of imperial in-laws.

51
00:04:26,545 --> 00:04:28,265
Now, common folks

52
00:04:28,345 --> 00:04:29,865
hate them a lot.

53
00:04:31,145 --> 00:04:32,545
Once the Xie Clan oversteps,

54
00:04:32,625 --> 00:04:35,105
even their reputation over a century

55
00:04:35,185 --> 00:04:36,665
won't make anyone forgive them.

56
00:04:38,825 --> 00:04:41,225
It makes sense, Mr. Deng. It makes sense.

57
00:04:43,345 --> 00:04:45,745
Xie Yanfang is cunning

58
00:04:45,825 --> 00:04:46,905
and sophisticated.

59
00:04:46,985 --> 00:04:49,105
He excels at seeking good fame.

60
00:04:49,185 --> 00:04:51,385
Now, he's the Emperor's uncle.

61
00:04:51,465 --> 00:04:54,065
Many people entrust him

62
00:04:54,145 --> 00:04:54,985
with state affairs.

63
00:04:55,065 --> 00:04:56,945
His reputation has grown.

64
00:04:57,025 --> 00:05:00,665
But the Xie Clan
has more than just Xie Yanfang.

65
00:05:00,745 --> 00:05:03,505
Leaving others aside,
his brother, Xie Yanlai,

66
00:05:05,065 --> 00:05:09,065
behaves quite arrogantly,
just like the Yang and Zhao Clans.

67
00:05:09,905 --> 00:05:12,105
Well, Xie Yanlai is quite extraordinary.

68
00:05:13,065 --> 00:05:14,745
He can even manipulate His Majesty.

69
00:05:14,825 --> 00:05:17,425
I would rather say

70
00:05:18,345 --> 00:05:20,545
someone else manipulates His Majesty.

71
00:05:22,105 --> 00:05:24,385
The Grand Princess
does not trust Xie Yanfang.

72
00:05:24,985 --> 00:05:26,505
But she shows Xie Yanlai

73
00:05:27,025 --> 00:05:28,265
special favor.

74
00:05:28,865 --> 00:05:30,425
And why is that?

75
00:05:31,305 --> 00:05:32,505
Maybe

76
00:05:34,465 --> 00:05:36,585
she wants to raise up a new imperial uncle

77
00:05:37,185 --> 00:05:38,585
to cause infighting.

78
00:05:39,905 --> 00:05:41,625
When brothers turn against each other,

79
00:05:41,705 --> 00:05:43,985
a fight for status would be the worst.

80
00:05:44,065 --> 00:05:46,585
Xie Yanlai is favored
and supported by the Grand Princess.

81
00:05:46,665 --> 00:05:49,305
If he fights for power,

82
00:05:49,385 --> 00:05:52,465
Xie Yanfang will surely have a headache.

83
00:05:57,105 --> 00:05:58,145
Father.

84
00:05:59,505 --> 00:06:00,545
Father.

85
00:06:01,825 --> 00:06:05,225
Our spy's latest report says
Chu Ling has been unconscious for days.

86
00:06:05,905 --> 00:06:07,025
He's probably dying.

87
00:06:08,705 --> 00:06:09,785
Xun,

88
00:06:10,625 --> 00:06:12,465
look at the alchemy fire behind me.

89
00:06:13,545 --> 00:06:14,585
Spiritual elixirs can only be done

90
00:06:15,425 --> 00:06:16,665
by slow simmering.

91
00:06:16,745 --> 00:06:19,425
An intense fire will end in vain.

92
00:06:19,505 --> 00:06:22,145
Your rash alliance
with the Northern Desert at Wangcheng

93
00:06:22,225 --> 00:06:23,465
utterly failed.

94
00:06:23,545 --> 00:06:25,345
Do you realize your fault?

95
00:06:25,425 --> 00:06:26,625
Father,

96
00:06:26,705 --> 00:06:29,545
I had a perfect plan
for the battle of Wangcheng.

97
00:06:30,185 --> 00:06:31,705
But Chu Zhao interfered.

98
00:06:33,225 --> 00:06:35,505
Once something goes wrong,
your plan cannot be branded as perfect.

99
00:06:41,025 --> 00:06:41,945
Father,

100
00:06:42,905 --> 00:06:44,025
fortunately,

101
00:06:44,545 --> 00:06:47,825
I eliminated their remnants.
No future threats will be left.

102
00:06:48,665 --> 00:06:49,665
Don't worry, Father.

103
00:06:56,905 --> 00:06:59,185
How many times have I told you?

104
00:07:00,185 --> 00:07:03,145
To seek great things,
you must behave like the stove fire.

105
00:07:03,905 --> 00:07:04,985
You should stay patient

106
00:07:05,065 --> 00:07:06,825
until the right moment comes.

107
00:07:07,425 --> 00:07:08,905
I don't quite agree.

108
00:07:10,465 --> 00:07:13,825
The war between the two states
has been going on for days,

109
00:07:13,905 --> 00:07:15,385
but it's not intense.

110
00:07:15,465 --> 00:07:17,105
Victory reports in the Capital

111
00:07:17,625 --> 00:07:18,785
make people feel

112
00:07:18,865 --> 00:07:20,825
that the Northern Desert
is merely bluffing.

113
00:07:21,425 --> 00:07:22,545
Actually, that's not true.

114
00:07:22,625 --> 00:07:24,505
The Northern Desert Royal Army

115
00:07:25,025 --> 00:07:25,865
has been waiting

116
00:07:25,945 --> 00:07:28,465
for a chance to strike a fatal blow.

117
00:07:29,865 --> 00:07:32,185
The chance is the death of Chu Ling.

118
00:07:32,705 --> 00:07:34,265
You're being too impatient.

119
00:07:34,945 --> 00:07:38,345
Northern Desert foes are treacherous.
They aren't a reliable ally.

120
00:07:38,425 --> 00:07:39,545
Father,

121
00:07:39,625 --> 00:07:41,625
let me lead troops to Yunzhong.

122
00:07:43,065 --> 00:07:45,625
The Royal Army has gathered and departed.

123
00:07:45,705 --> 00:07:48,225
They're determined to win this battle.

124
00:07:48,825 --> 00:07:50,825
Chu Ling is on his last legs.

125
00:07:51,505 --> 00:07:52,665
He won't live long.

126
00:07:53,505 --> 00:07:55,185
It's time for us to turn the tide.

127
00:07:56,385 --> 00:07:57,945
Even if Chu Ling dies,

128
00:07:59,545 --> 00:08:01,945
his army can still fight a war.

129
00:08:02,545 --> 00:08:03,825
What you should do

130
00:08:04,545 --> 00:08:06,025
is to lead troops to the Capital

131
00:08:08,105 --> 00:08:09,185
and guard the Emperor.

132
00:08:14,465 --> 00:08:15,465
Yes.

133
00:08:34,745 --> 00:08:36,505
-Go get Mr. Zhong.
-Yes.

134
00:08:43,865 --> 00:08:45,665
Zhao, scouts reported

135
00:08:45,745 --> 00:08:48,865
the Northern Desert Royal Army
passed Heishui Ridge

136
00:08:48,945 --> 00:08:50,825
and is less than a hundred li away.

137
00:08:50,905 --> 00:08:52,945
Beacon towers along the way were ruined.

138
00:08:53,025 --> 00:08:54,505
I'm afraid they'll arrive very soon.

139
00:08:54,585 --> 00:08:56,945
We must make early plans.

140
00:08:58,105 --> 00:09:01,185
Looks like their king knows
about Father's condition.

141
00:09:03,865 --> 00:09:05,065
He knows the time has come.

142
00:09:05,745 --> 00:09:07,985
The General's condition
has been kept secret.

143
00:09:08,065 --> 00:09:09,065
I don't know why…

144
00:09:09,145 --> 00:09:11,505
Nothing stays hidden forever.

145
00:09:13,185 --> 00:09:15,145
Now, there's no need

146
00:09:16,265 --> 00:09:17,305
to hunt for spies.

147
00:09:25,745 --> 00:09:28,465
Since their king
has led the troops himself,

148
00:09:30,025 --> 00:09:31,905
I will command our troops

149
00:09:33,185 --> 00:09:34,585
to fight them

150
00:09:35,865 --> 00:09:37,225
on behalf of my father.

151
00:09:38,625 --> 00:09:40,025
The commander's absence from the war

152
00:09:41,945 --> 00:09:43,905
will surely affect the army's morale.

153
00:09:46,185 --> 00:09:47,585
If a woman like me

154
00:09:48,465 --> 00:09:50,505
took command in her father's place,

155
00:09:51,945 --> 00:09:53,345
the result wouldn't be as good.

156
00:09:55,465 --> 00:09:56,305
But luckily,

157
00:09:57,345 --> 00:09:59,745
I'm not only Chu Ling's daughter,

158
00:10:00,705 --> 00:10:03,185
but also the Grand Princess of State.

159
00:10:04,145 --> 00:10:05,905
Heed my order, Zhong Changrong.

160
00:10:06,825 --> 00:10:07,665
Yes.

161
00:10:08,185 --> 00:10:09,945
Prepare the Grand Princess's procession.

162
00:10:12,945 --> 00:10:14,225
We'll set out for war.

163
00:10:21,065 --> 00:10:23,025
The secrets of Xie Clan of Gaoyang

164
00:10:23,545 --> 00:10:26,145
are indeed more spectacular
than I imagined.

165
00:10:26,745 --> 00:10:28,225
All who surrender,

166
00:10:28,305 --> 00:10:29,505
for any reason,

167
00:10:30,185 --> 00:10:32,265
shall be executed immediately

168
00:10:32,345 --> 00:10:34,065
and excluded from the ancestral graves.

169
00:10:34,865 --> 00:10:36,225
The Xie's secret elixir

170
00:10:36,745 --> 00:10:38,705
can bring the dead back to life.

171
00:10:39,385 --> 00:10:40,945
It's kept by the clan head.

172
00:10:41,465 --> 00:10:43,025
Only the direct line can see it.

173
00:10:45,785 --> 00:10:47,985
Bring the dead back to life?

174
00:10:50,625 --> 00:10:51,585
How interesting.

175
00:10:54,505 --> 00:10:56,305
Knowing that my father is gravely ill,

176
00:10:56,385 --> 00:10:58,305
400,000 Northern Desert troops came up,

177
00:10:58,385 --> 00:10:59,625
trying to capture Yunzhong.

178
00:11:06,145 --> 00:11:07,185
Mr. Zhong,

179
00:11:07,265 --> 00:11:09,865
you lead main troops
to confront the enemy's main force.

180
00:11:10,465 --> 00:11:11,305
Yes.

181
00:11:12,865 --> 00:11:14,545
-I'll go with Zhong.
-No.

182
00:11:15,145 --> 00:11:17,745
You take the Vanguard Battalion
to charge out from the left wing,

183
00:11:17,825 --> 00:11:18,665
go through Yingzui Valley,

184
00:11:19,265 --> 00:11:21,305
and circle around to the enemy's rear.

185
00:11:21,825 --> 00:11:23,425
You and Mr. Zhong launch a pincer attack

186
00:11:23,505 --> 00:11:25,065
to break up the enemy's assault.

187
00:11:25,665 --> 00:11:26,505
Yes.

188
00:11:27,105 --> 00:11:29,145
If you fail this mission,
you'll be punished.

189
00:11:30,465 --> 00:11:33,425
Yingzui Valley is vital.
Our enemies also know that.

190
00:11:33,505 --> 00:11:35,625
-They'll guard it with massive forces.
-I take your order.

191
00:11:39,345 --> 00:11:40,905
I pledge to take Yingzui Valley.

192
00:11:41,745 --> 00:11:42,585
Move out now.

193
00:11:43,185 --> 00:11:44,025
-Yes.
-Yes.

194
00:11:44,105 --> 00:11:46,705
We swear to live and die for Yunzhong.

195
00:11:47,305 --> 00:11:48,145
In this battle,

196
00:11:48,665 --> 00:11:50,545
I will make our enemies know

197
00:11:51,065 --> 00:11:53,505
that we will never yield a single inch
of our own territory.

198
00:12:03,825 --> 00:12:05,505
YUNZHONG

199
00:12:41,305 --> 00:12:44,345
When our state is in turmoil,

200
00:12:44,945 --> 00:12:46,065
our late Emperor is gone,

201
00:12:46,585 --> 00:12:49,905
and our new emperor is still young,
the Northern Desert invades our frontier

202
00:12:50,585 --> 00:12:51,825
and slaughters our people.

203
00:12:51,905 --> 00:12:54,185
As the Grand Princess of State,

204
00:12:54,705 --> 00:12:56,945
I must protect all the people.

205
00:12:57,025 --> 00:12:58,345
In the name

206
00:12:59,105 --> 00:13:01,945
of the Grand Princess of State,
I condemn the Northern Desert.

207
00:13:02,025 --> 00:13:03,905
Those who invade our land…

208
00:13:03,985 --> 00:13:04,825
Kill them!

209
00:13:05,425 --> 00:13:07,025
Those who butcher our people…

210
00:13:07,105 --> 00:13:07,945
Kill them!

211
00:13:08,705 --> 00:13:09,985
Soldiers,

212
00:13:10,505 --> 00:13:12,345
follow me in killing the enemies!

213
00:13:13,305 --> 00:13:15,065
We'll defend our territory

214
00:13:16,145 --> 00:13:17,785
and guard our people!

215
00:13:17,865 --> 00:13:23,025
-Kill!
-Kill!

216
00:13:23,105 --> 00:13:26,825
-Kill!
-Kill!

217
00:13:27,425 --> 00:13:31,345
-Kill!
-Kill!

218
00:13:31,425 --> 00:13:32,225
Let's kill!

219
00:13:36,945 --> 00:13:37,785
Charge!

220
00:13:44,065 --> 00:13:46,105
Charge!

221
00:13:50,545 --> 00:13:53,665
YINGZUI VALLEY

222
00:14:11,825 --> 00:14:12,665
How dare

223
00:14:13,585 --> 00:14:15,105
those northern foes invade our land!

224
00:14:15,185 --> 00:14:16,665
-Don't die.
-You either.

225
00:15:10,025 --> 00:15:11,465
At this rate, we can't hold on.

226
00:15:11,545 --> 00:15:14,265
Without reinforcements, we'll lose.
Hold on, all of you!

227
00:15:14,785 --> 00:15:17,505
Frontier soldiers like us would rather
die on the battlefield!

228
00:15:33,425 --> 00:15:34,905
The Grand Princess of State.

229
00:15:34,985 --> 00:15:38,985
Anyone who kills the Grand Princess
will win a title.

230
00:15:39,065 --> 00:15:41,265
Kill!

231
00:15:55,425 --> 00:15:56,265
Why are you here?

232
00:15:56,345 --> 00:15:58,185
To do what a mother should do.

233
00:15:58,265 --> 00:16:00,225
You've suffered heavy casualties.

234
00:16:00,305 --> 00:16:02,065
Unless you break through here,

235
00:16:02,145 --> 00:16:04,585
even the reinforcements
will be trapped and killed at this pass.

236
00:16:04,665 --> 00:16:06,145
It's Alan Ruoying.

237
00:16:07,025 --> 00:16:09,425
The traitor our king
has been hunting for 19 years.

238
00:16:09,505 --> 00:16:10,865
How come she's here?

239
00:16:10,945 --> 00:16:12,425
Catch Alan Ruoying alive!

240
00:16:22,225 --> 00:16:23,065
I still failed

241
00:16:23,665 --> 00:16:26,625
to be the perfect mother in your heart.

242
00:16:29,025 --> 00:16:30,105
I'm sorry.

243
00:16:31,625 --> 00:16:34,305
I can find a way to break through.
Don't do anything stupid!

244
00:16:34,385 --> 00:16:36,865
That day, you said
you would grant me a reward.

245
00:16:37,985 --> 00:16:39,905
Now, I'm asking for this reward.

246
00:16:45,425 --> 00:16:46,585
I want you to live.

247
00:16:48,625 --> 00:16:50,705
You want to know
how I've been all these years.

248
00:16:51,745 --> 00:16:54,585
You also want to know
if I have forgiven you.

249
00:16:55,505 --> 00:16:56,745
If you die,

250
00:16:57,505 --> 00:16:59,505
you will never know the answers.

251
00:17:06,625 --> 00:17:08,105
Actually, I know.

252
00:17:11,305 --> 00:17:12,424
I've always known.

253
00:17:13,025 --> 00:17:14,385
No!

254
00:17:14,985 --> 00:17:16,145
Mother!

255
00:17:16,785 --> 00:17:17,745
Don't go!

256
00:17:18,265 --> 00:17:20,065
Don't leave me alone!

257
00:17:25,865 --> 00:17:26,785
Mother!

258
00:17:44,345 --> 00:17:46,265
Mother!

259
00:19:12,425 --> 00:19:13,345
General.

260
00:19:13,425 --> 00:19:16,185
It's the General.
He's beating the drum to cheer us on!

261
00:19:28,865 --> 00:19:32,105
Kill!

262
00:19:33,065 --> 00:19:34,625
My mother

263
00:19:36,225 --> 00:19:37,905
asked me to live.

264
00:19:38,465 --> 00:19:40,145
Soldiers, on my command!

265
00:19:41,025 --> 00:19:43,665
-Kill!
-Kill!

266
00:20:00,785 --> 00:20:01,945
<i>‎Listen to the roar of battle.</i>

267
00:20:04,385 --> 00:20:05,865
Her Highness is as good as you, General.

268
00:20:06,705 --> 00:20:08,705
She's fighting alongside Jiu
to kill the enemies.

269
00:20:19,145 --> 00:20:20,185
Zhao,

270
00:20:21,665 --> 00:20:24,385
you must stay alive.

271
00:21:15,945 --> 00:21:16,985
General…

272
00:21:18,305 --> 00:21:20,465
General!

273
00:21:29,625 --> 00:21:31,025
Father.

274
00:21:31,105 --> 00:21:32,065
We…

275
00:21:51,505 --> 00:21:52,865
-General.
-General.

276
00:22:42,985 --> 00:22:43,825
Father.

277
00:22:46,585 --> 00:22:48,265
We won.

278
00:22:59,185 --> 00:23:00,225
The General

279
00:23:01,665 --> 00:23:02,865
died on the battlefield

280
00:23:03,785 --> 00:23:05,345
the way he wished.

281
00:23:14,105 --> 00:23:15,145
Zhao.

282
00:23:22,225 --> 00:23:23,145
All of you, leave us.

283
00:23:24,905 --> 00:23:25,745
-Yes.
-Yes.

284
00:23:54,025 --> 00:23:55,505
Mu Mianhong blasted open

285
00:23:57,905 --> 00:23:59,585
the pass at Yingzui Valley for us.

286
00:24:11,945 --> 00:24:13,385
Father didn't lie to me.

287
00:24:16,785 --> 00:24:18,265
My mother

288
00:24:19,945 --> 00:24:22,025
is the best woman in the world.

289
00:24:24,105 --> 00:24:25,105
She's kind

290
00:24:26,945 --> 00:24:27,945
and brave,

291
00:24:29,705 --> 00:24:30,865
and she loves me.

292
00:24:33,625 --> 00:24:34,865
Mr. Zhong,

293
00:24:37,465 --> 00:24:38,545
my mother…

294
00:24:40,705 --> 00:24:42,145
She loves me.

295
00:24:43,265 --> 00:24:45,665
She protected me with her own life.

296
00:24:46,585 --> 00:24:47,425
Zhao,

297
00:24:47,505 --> 00:24:49,785
if you feel sad,

298
00:24:49,865 --> 00:24:51,425
let it all out.

299
00:24:52,025 --> 00:24:53,025
Sad?

300
00:24:54,065 --> 00:24:55,225
I'm not sad.

301
00:24:59,185 --> 00:25:01,825
My father watched us defeat our enemies.

302
00:25:03,065 --> 00:25:04,065
And now,

303
00:25:05,145 --> 00:25:06,505
he and my mother

304
00:25:07,265 --> 00:25:08,785
can be reunited in the underworld.

305
00:25:10,305 --> 00:25:12,985
They no longer need
to worry about mortal affairs.

306
00:25:14,985 --> 00:25:16,305
I feel happy for them.

307
00:25:40,105 --> 00:25:41,225
Make an announcement.

308
00:25:41,305 --> 00:25:43,265
Guard General Chu Ling

309
00:25:46,185 --> 00:25:47,025
passed away.

310
00:25:48,905 --> 00:25:50,025
Now?

311
00:25:50,545 --> 00:25:51,465
Is it appropriate?

312
00:25:51,545 --> 00:25:54,065
The Northern Desert King lost and fled,

313
00:25:54,145 --> 00:25:55,545
but the war isn't over yet.

314
00:25:56,145 --> 00:25:58,425
If we announce the General's death now,

315
00:25:59,225 --> 00:26:00,785
will our soldiers lose heart?

316
00:26:00,865 --> 00:26:02,305
Now is the time.

317
00:26:04,225 --> 00:26:05,545
We should let them know

318
00:26:06,945 --> 00:26:09,265
the General has fought with them
and died in battle.

319
00:26:12,025 --> 00:26:13,345
A general like him,

320
00:26:13,945 --> 00:26:15,225
even when he's gone,

321
00:26:16,985 --> 00:26:19,265
the soldiers will believe
he's still there for them.

322
00:26:20,465 --> 00:26:22,625
Even if the enemies return at once,

323
00:26:23,585 --> 00:26:25,025
they will be fearless.

324
00:26:27,705 --> 00:26:30,065
My father used the last of his strength

325
00:26:30,585 --> 00:26:32,185
to repel the enemies.

326
00:26:33,825 --> 00:26:35,345
When we announce his death now,

327
00:26:36,625 --> 00:26:38,425
grief shall turn into strength

328
00:26:39,425 --> 00:26:40,865
instead of panic.

329
00:26:43,305 --> 00:26:44,585
We're fearless.

330
00:26:45,585 --> 00:26:47,225
We're invincible.

331
00:26:52,425 --> 00:26:53,505
Our state

332
00:26:54,305 --> 00:26:55,425
will win!

333
00:27:07,065 --> 00:27:11,065
-Guard General Chu Ling! Farewell!
-Guard General Chu Ling! Farewell!

334
00:27:11,145 --> 00:27:15,385
-Guard General Chu Ling! Farewell!
-Guard General Chu Ling! Farewell!

335
00:27:15,985 --> 00:27:19,345
-Guard General Chu Ling! Farewell!
-Guard General Chu Ling! Farewell!

336
00:27:27,145 --> 00:27:30,385
-Guard General Chu Ling! Farewell!
-Guard General Chu Ling! Farewell!

337
00:27:30,465 --> 00:27:33,625
-Guard General Chu Ling! Farewell!
-Guard General Chu Ling! Farewell!

338
00:28:23,665 --> 00:28:26,225
You haven't slept for three days.
Are you torturing yourself?

339
00:28:36,665 --> 00:28:37,505
I'm sorry.

340
00:28:39,065 --> 00:28:39,905
Satisfied, huh?

341
00:28:48,225 --> 00:28:49,625
Why must you push me?

342
00:28:49,705 --> 00:28:51,625
Must you see how I break down?

343
00:28:52,305 --> 00:28:53,545
Xie Yanlai,

344
00:28:53,625 --> 00:28:56,785
does it make you happy
when you crush my composure?

345
00:29:02,625 --> 00:29:04,225
Do you know why I can't close my eyes?

346
00:29:05,505 --> 00:29:06,625
Because when I close my eyes,

347
00:29:07,625 --> 00:29:09,905
I see how my mother
sacrificed her life before me.

348
00:29:11,345 --> 00:29:12,905
And I see

349
00:29:13,945 --> 00:29:15,825
how my father passed away
with his eyes still open.

350
00:29:17,505 --> 00:29:18,945
How am I supposed to face this?

351
00:29:20,105 --> 00:29:21,745
How can I not hate or feel pain?

352
00:29:22,425 --> 00:29:23,865
It's your fault. He could have lived.

353
00:29:23,945 --> 00:29:26,225
Even if he remained feeble,
he could at least be alive!

354
00:29:27,025 --> 00:29:29,665
If he lived, I wouldn't be an orphan.

355
00:29:29,745 --> 00:29:31,385
You're the murderer.

356
00:29:31,905 --> 00:29:33,385
My mother died before me,

357
00:29:33,905 --> 00:29:35,945
and you killed my father. It's you!

358
00:30:03,585 --> 00:30:04,505
Zhao.

359
00:30:23,185 --> 00:30:24,025
Mr. Deng,

360
00:30:24,105 --> 00:30:25,945
we looked into the Xie's secret elixir.

361
00:30:31,025 --> 00:30:32,265
It's the Bloodburn Pill.

362
00:30:32,345 --> 00:30:34,225
It's peculiarly poisonous.

363
00:30:34,305 --> 00:30:36,945
Its power to revive the dead is a fraud.

364
00:30:37,025 --> 00:30:38,305
Every time it is used,

365
00:30:38,385 --> 00:30:39,585
death comes closer.

366
00:30:40,705 --> 00:30:42,425
The bloodburn energy

367
00:30:43,545 --> 00:30:44,865
has a supernatural effect,

368
00:30:45,505 --> 00:30:46,905
so it takes a supernatural cost.

369
00:30:47,945 --> 00:30:49,625
Everything in this world

370
00:30:50,145 --> 00:30:51,945
has been destined.

371
00:30:59,425 --> 00:31:00,505
Three years ago,

372
00:31:01,025 --> 00:31:03,065
Chu Ling was badly injured in a battle.

373
00:31:03,145 --> 00:31:05,705
He healed quickly
and won battles in the next year

374
00:31:05,785 --> 00:31:06,665
as if he were blessed.

375
00:31:07,265 --> 00:31:08,705
Yet his body kept getting worse.

376
00:31:08,785 --> 00:31:10,425
He coughed up blood and went blind.

377
00:31:10,505 --> 00:31:13,305
No one around him except Xie Yanlai

378
00:31:13,385 --> 00:31:15,265
was able to do that.

379
00:31:15,985 --> 00:31:17,465
This can't possibly be a coincidence.

380
00:31:17,545 --> 00:31:19,665
Are you saying

381
00:31:20,185 --> 00:31:21,185
the Xie Family

382
00:31:21,905 --> 00:31:23,025
poisoned Chu Ling?

383
00:31:23,785 --> 00:31:25,945
I wonder how the Grand Princess

384
00:31:26,025 --> 00:31:28,345
will feel when she knows

385
00:31:28,425 --> 00:31:30,025
her most trusted Xie Yanlai

386
00:31:30,985 --> 00:31:32,465
poisoned her father.

387
00:31:34,025 --> 00:31:35,385
Announcement from the frontier!

388
00:31:35,465 --> 00:31:37,065
Guard General Chu Ling passed away!

389
00:31:37,145 --> 00:31:38,705
Announcement from the frontier!

390
00:31:39,305 --> 00:31:40,945
Guard General Chu Ling passed away!

391
00:31:41,465 --> 00:31:43,105
Announcement from the frontier!

392
00:31:43,185 --> 00:31:45,265
-Guard General Chu Ling passed away!
-Shao You.

393
00:31:46,545 --> 00:31:47,545
Guess.

394
00:31:49,185 --> 00:31:51,985
Can we use the death of the God of War

395
00:31:52,665 --> 00:31:55,345
to uproot the Xie Clan
from their century-old power?

396
00:31:56,585 --> 00:31:58,065
Go spread the news.

397
00:31:58,985 --> 00:32:00,585
Make sure everyone knows it.

398
00:32:01,825 --> 00:32:02,665
Yes.

399
00:32:08,305 --> 00:32:10,625
His Lordship is right. Chu Ling is gone,

400
00:32:11,145 --> 00:32:13,625
but it's still hard to invade Yunzhong.

401
00:32:13,705 --> 00:32:15,625
Luckily, you took his advice

402
00:32:15,705 --> 00:32:16,545
not to act rashly.

403
00:32:17,865 --> 00:32:20,105
Once again, they ruined

404
00:32:20,625 --> 00:32:21,585
such a great chance.

405
00:32:21,665 --> 00:32:23,025
Calm down.

406
00:32:23,545 --> 00:32:24,785
We'll find another chance.

407
00:32:27,465 --> 00:32:29,025
Chu Ling is dead.

408
00:32:29,985 --> 00:32:31,185
Under such circumstances,

409
00:32:32,185 --> 00:32:34,585
Xie Yanlai is most likely
to take over his troops.

410
00:32:35,545 --> 00:32:36,705
Xie Yanlai

411
00:32:37,305 --> 00:32:39,505
ruined your plan at Cangmu Stronghold

412
00:32:39,585 --> 00:32:41,705
and then helped Chu Zhao
defeat the enemies.

413
00:32:41,785 --> 00:32:44,945
If he takes command,
he'll be a huge threat.

414
00:32:51,065 --> 00:32:52,105
Tie Ying.

415
00:32:54,625 --> 00:32:55,625
Think about it.

416
00:32:56,145 --> 00:32:59,065
Rumors that Chu Ling
was killed by the Xie's secret elixir

417
00:33:00,185 --> 00:33:01,425
have spread to the Capital.

418
00:33:03,465 --> 00:33:06,425
Chu Ling enjoyed immense prestige
in Yunzhong.

419
00:33:07,185 --> 00:33:08,265
Those frontier troops.

420
00:33:09,545 --> 00:33:11,985
Those common people under his protection.

421
00:33:14,865 --> 00:33:15,905
Tell me.

422
00:33:16,945 --> 00:33:18,785
Do you think Xie Yanlai, the murderer,

423
00:33:21,185 --> 00:33:22,905
can leave Yunzhong alive?

424
00:33:23,625 --> 00:33:24,625
In my opinion,

425
00:33:25,145 --> 00:33:27,585
he can't. Frontier folks are loyal.

426
00:33:27,665 --> 00:33:30,305
If they believe
Xie Yanlai poisoned General Chu…

427
00:33:32,225 --> 00:33:33,105
Good.

428
00:33:34,105 --> 00:33:35,265
Very good.

429
00:33:36,705 --> 00:33:39,345
Since rumors have reached the Capital,

430
00:33:40,705 --> 00:33:42,785
we'll add fuel to the fire.

431
00:33:43,585 --> 00:33:44,905
Spread the news to Yunzhong

432
00:33:45,425 --> 00:33:46,785
as quickly as possible.

433
00:33:48,185 --> 00:33:49,865
I can't wait to see

434
00:33:50,785 --> 00:33:53,865
how he gets crushed by angry people

435
00:33:54,625 --> 00:33:56,385
and perishes in misery.

436
00:33:56,465 --> 00:33:57,545
TAIJI HALL

437
00:33:57,625 --> 00:33:59,065
There are rumors

438
00:33:59,705 --> 00:34:02,265
that General Chu Ling was killed
by the Xie's secret elixir,

439
00:34:02,345 --> 00:34:03,705
the Bloodburn Pill.

440
00:34:04,665 --> 00:34:07,305
These mere rumors
have spread far and wide.

441
00:34:08,545 --> 00:34:10,824
Mr. Xie, what's your opinion?

442
00:34:10,905 --> 00:34:13,425
Mr. Deng, I'm not

443
00:34:13,505 --> 00:34:15,505
as well-informed as you.

444
00:34:16,545 --> 00:34:18,304
I didn't hear those rumors until today.

445
00:34:18,905 --> 00:34:20,545
Then, ministers,

446
00:34:21,065 --> 00:34:24,344
what do you think when one single clan

447
00:34:24,945 --> 00:34:26,264
has such poison?

448
00:34:27,185 --> 00:34:28,945
General Chu Ling died.

449
00:34:29,025 --> 00:34:33,065
Who knows if one of us
will be poisoned next?

450
00:34:35,505 --> 00:34:37,545
Mr. Deng has a point.

451
00:34:37,625 --> 00:34:40,304
If someone evil uses such poison,

452
00:34:40,385 --> 00:34:42,225
the consequences would be terrible.

453
00:34:42,304 --> 00:34:44,185
It makes sense, Censor.

454
00:34:45,744 --> 00:34:48,225
But lately, I've heard
about something fun.

455
00:34:49,225 --> 00:34:51,225
Mr. Deng is keeping

456
00:34:52,585 --> 00:34:54,585
the late Emperor's relics.

457
00:34:55,344 --> 00:34:56,185
Mr. Deng,

458
00:34:56,705 --> 00:34:58,345
what do you have to say?

459
00:34:59,905 --> 00:35:00,945
Mr. Xie,

460
00:35:01,025 --> 00:35:02,705
how can you

461
00:35:03,705 --> 00:35:06,225
make irresponsible remarks
about the late Emperor?

462
00:35:06,305 --> 00:35:08,305
You guessed groundlessly, too.

463
00:35:08,385 --> 00:35:10,225
How could you blame me

464
00:35:10,905 --> 00:35:12,345
for doing the same?

465
00:35:13,865 --> 00:35:14,825
That's right, Your Majesty.

466
00:35:14,905 --> 00:35:18,465
General Chu was in poor health
for a long time.

467
00:35:18,545 --> 00:35:21,825
Why did people suddenly say
he was poisoned?

468
00:35:21,905 --> 00:35:23,825
Even in that case,

469
00:35:23,905 --> 00:35:27,265
why did the Xie Family get involved?

470
00:35:27,345 --> 00:35:29,625
Victory news has just arrived.

471
00:35:29,705 --> 00:35:32,385
Frontier troops
are still fighting enemies.

472
00:35:32,465 --> 00:35:33,465
Mr. Deng,

473
00:35:33,545 --> 00:35:36,745
such rumors will break
the soldiers' hearts.

474
00:35:37,505 --> 00:35:40,785
As the saying goes,
nothing comes from nothing.

475
00:35:40,865 --> 00:35:44,145
Whether the Xie Family
has this secret elixir,

476
00:35:44,745 --> 00:35:46,305
Mr. Xie,

477
00:35:46,385 --> 00:35:49,265
you should know it perfectly.

478
00:35:49,345 --> 00:35:50,225
Your brother Xie Yanlai

479
00:35:50,305 --> 00:35:54,265
lurked by General Chu's side
for five years.

480
00:35:54,345 --> 00:35:55,665
There could be plenty of chances

481
00:35:55,745 --> 00:35:57,865
that he could poison the General.

482
00:35:59,625 --> 00:36:00,665
Stop arguing!

483
00:36:01,425 --> 00:36:02,545
Our enemies have just retreated.

484
00:36:03,145 --> 00:36:05,825
All parts of our state
should unite against them.

485
00:36:06,545 --> 00:36:08,065
I don't want to hear you argue.

486
00:36:08,985 --> 00:36:09,985
I just want to ask

487
00:36:11,065 --> 00:36:13,025
when my sister and my uncle

488
00:36:13,105 --> 00:36:14,425
will come back.

489
00:36:14,945 --> 00:36:15,865
Your Majesty,

490
00:36:15,945 --> 00:36:18,585
the Grand Princess
is in mourning for General Chu.

491
00:36:19,105 --> 00:36:21,425
When the war is over
and the funeral is done,

492
00:36:21,945 --> 00:36:23,305
she will come back.

493
00:36:24,025 --> 00:36:25,025
But…

494
00:36:25,705 --> 00:36:26,905
General Chu is gone.

495
00:36:26,985 --> 00:36:29,025
Let's not dwell

496
00:36:29,545 --> 00:36:32,105
on a lady's mourning for her father.

497
00:36:32,705 --> 00:36:34,625
General Chu is a pillar of our state.

498
00:36:34,705 --> 00:36:37,105
He deserves generous rewards.

499
00:36:37,625 --> 00:36:39,025
Even when he's dead,

500
00:36:39,105 --> 00:36:40,865
to boost morale,

501
00:36:40,945 --> 00:36:42,625
frontier troops who won this battle

502
00:36:42,705 --> 00:36:45,425
should be rewarded.

503
00:36:45,505 --> 00:36:46,345
It makes sense.

504
00:36:47,185 --> 00:36:49,065
General Chu is our backbone.

505
00:36:49,145 --> 00:36:50,865
He deserves a national funeral.

506
00:36:51,625 --> 00:36:52,825
Wise decision, Your Majesty.

507
00:36:54,065 --> 00:36:56,145
Mr. Xie, you really

508
00:36:57,225 --> 00:36:58,825
prioritize the greater good.

509
00:37:06,025 --> 00:37:07,505
How long

510
00:37:08,025 --> 00:37:09,145
do you think

511
00:37:09,745 --> 00:37:10,865
this secret can be kept?

512
00:37:11,745 --> 00:37:13,305
If you're so confident,

513
00:37:14,145 --> 00:37:15,665
why don't you ask my brother

514
00:37:16,425 --> 00:37:18,065
when he comes back?

515
00:37:20,145 --> 00:37:21,065
Oh.

516
00:37:21,985 --> 00:37:23,785
The coffin from the Grand Princess…

517
00:37:24,465 --> 00:37:26,145
You can have it sent to Yunzhong

518
00:37:26,225 --> 00:37:29,185
for General Chu to express your sorrow.

519
00:37:31,945 --> 00:37:33,505
That's golden-thread nanmu, after all.

520
00:37:35,465 --> 00:37:37,385
You wouldn't be reluctant, would you?

521
00:38:03,145 --> 00:38:05,585
After only a few minutes,
you can't read anymore.

522
00:38:06,345 --> 00:38:08,665
Those dense words

523
00:38:09,545 --> 00:38:11,505
give me a headache.

524
00:38:12,345 --> 00:38:13,345
Father,

525
00:38:14,265 --> 00:38:15,665
shall we talk?

526
00:38:17,625 --> 00:38:18,745
About what?

527
00:38:18,825 --> 00:38:21,665
Tell me more about my mother.

528
00:38:38,945 --> 00:38:41,065
Father.

529
00:38:41,145 --> 00:38:43,785
Father.

530
00:38:51,025 --> 00:38:52,065
Are you hurt?

531
00:39:01,945 --> 00:39:02,785
Do you like it?

532
00:39:04,145 --> 00:39:05,745
Greetings, Lady General.

533
00:39:32,465 --> 00:39:34,065
I miss you so much.

534
00:39:43,185 --> 00:39:44,065
Zhao,

535
00:39:44,785 --> 00:39:47,025
I know you don't want to hear me out.

536
00:39:47,785 --> 00:39:48,825
But…

537
00:39:50,025 --> 00:39:52,145
it's unfair to Jiu.

538
00:39:56,825 --> 00:39:59,545
People say your father is the God of War

539
00:39:59,625 --> 00:40:00,665
who never loses a battle.

540
00:40:00,745 --> 00:40:02,705
As long as Chu Ling is around,

541
00:40:02,785 --> 00:40:04,665
the frontier will always be peaceful.

542
00:40:05,985 --> 00:40:07,825
But he's just an ordinary man.

543
00:40:08,345 --> 00:40:10,105
He got injured,

544
00:40:10,185 --> 00:40:11,985
fell sick, and died.

545
00:40:12,945 --> 00:40:13,945
<i>Three years ago,</i>

546
00:40:14,465 --> 00:40:15,385
<i>in the Battle of the Frontier River,</i>

547
00:40:16,185 --> 00:40:17,465
-<i>your father was shot by a poisoned arrow</i>
-Doctors!

548
00:40:17,545 --> 00:40:19,305
-<i>and nearly lost his life.</i>
-Doctors, help!

549
00:40:19,385 --> 00:40:21,625
<i>At that time,</i>

550
00:40:22,225 --> 00:40:24,105
<i>Jiu took out this pill.</i>

551
00:40:25,425 --> 00:40:27,025
The arrow has
the Northern Desert's poison!

552
00:40:28,065 --> 00:40:29,185
Any antidote?

553
00:40:29,265 --> 00:40:30,665
The toxin is inside him.

554
00:40:30,745 --> 00:40:32,265
I'll purge it first.

555
00:40:33,705 --> 00:40:36,025
But General, you must rest very well

556
00:40:36,105 --> 00:40:37,465
instead of going to war again.

557
00:40:37,545 --> 00:40:39,945
Otherwise, the remaining toxin
will spread all over,

558
00:40:40,025 --> 00:40:41,185
and you won't live.

559
00:40:41,265 --> 00:40:44,065
The war is urgent. It can't do without me.

560
00:40:44,145 --> 00:40:45,105
No, General.

561
00:40:45,185 --> 00:40:46,505
You're too weak to go to war again.

562
00:40:46,585 --> 00:40:50,225
I would rather die on the battlefield.

563
00:40:50,305 --> 00:40:53,025
-How could I just stay bedridden?
-General.

564
00:40:53,105 --> 00:40:54,345
-General.
-I rather die…

565
00:40:54,425 --> 00:40:56,545
Secret elixir from the Xie Clan.
A pill can revive the dying.

566
00:40:57,305 --> 00:40:58,145
Will you try it?

567
00:40:59,545 --> 00:41:01,865
Where did you get this pill?

568
00:41:02,465 --> 00:41:04,265
From my brother, before I left home.

569
00:41:04,345 --> 00:41:05,625
He wouldn't harm me.

570
00:41:06,425 --> 00:41:08,385
General, let me test it.

571
00:41:08,465 --> 00:41:09,625
There's no time for it.

572
00:41:10,305 --> 00:41:11,665
As long as it works,

573
00:41:12,385 --> 00:41:15,265
I will take it, even if it's poison.

574
00:41:16,185 --> 00:41:17,145
<i>Your father took it</i>

575
00:41:17,225 --> 00:41:19,345
<i>as his last hope.</i>

576
00:41:19,425 --> 00:41:21,225
To save his life,

577
00:41:21,745 --> 00:41:23,785
we had no choice but to take that risk.

578
00:41:24,545 --> 00:41:25,425
Anyway,

579
00:41:25,505 --> 00:41:27,825
without Jiu's pill,

580
00:41:28,425 --> 00:41:30,065
the General would have died that day.

581
00:41:34,705 --> 00:41:36,185
I, Zhong Changrong,

582
00:41:36,705 --> 00:41:38,625
swear on my life.

583
00:41:38,705 --> 00:41:41,105
When Jiu offered the pill,

584
00:41:41,185 --> 00:41:42,465
he told us his true identity

585
00:41:42,545 --> 00:41:45,105
instead of hiding anything.

586
00:41:45,185 --> 00:41:47,505
The General was almost dying,

587
00:41:47,585 --> 00:41:50,105
and we had to take that risk.

588
00:41:50,825 --> 00:41:51,665
Report!

589
00:41:52,905 --> 00:41:54,225
Xie Yanlai is kneeling in public
to beg for forgiveness.

590
00:41:54,305 --> 00:41:55,625
Crowds have surrounded him.

591
00:41:55,705 --> 00:41:57,265
It's utter chaos out there.

